      [1;34m"body"[m[1;37m:[m [32m"Also saw a bunch of v_readfirstlane_b32` in the MoE Gluon Kernel.\n\n[IR_moe_gluon_4x512x1024_t128a4_fp8xmx4_4w3b_128x512x256_sliceMNK_20260706_1.tar.gz](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29760758/IR_moe_gluon_4x512x1024_t128a4_fp8xmx4_4w3b_128x512x256_sliceMNK_20260706_1.tar.gz)"[m[1;37m,[m
